<header class="head"><div class="shell head-inner"><a class="brand" href="/">GWAP GANG</a><nav class="nav"><a href="/intelligence/">Intelligence</a><a href="/capital/">Capital</a><a href="/revenue-rescue-sprint/">Revenue Rescue</a></nav></div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero">
<div class="shell hero-grid">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">Gwap Gang // Free Commercial Diagnostic</div>
<h1>Find Where Demand Leaks.</h1>
<p class="lead">Get a bounded public-evidence scan of your current buying path. Gwap looks for observable conversion friction, trust gaps, routing problems, and measurement blind spots without pretending we can see private revenue data.</p>
<div class="trust"><span class="pill">Free</span><span class="pill">No login</span><span class="pill">Public evidence only</span><span class="pill">No fake revenue estimates</span></div>
</div>

<form class="form-card" id="score-form">
<div class="eyebrow">Revenue Leak Score V0.1</div>
<h2>Run the diagnostic.</h2>
<p>About two minutes of context helps us distinguish a cosmetic website issue from a commercially meaningful leak.</p>
<div class="form-grid">
<div class="field full"><label for="businessName">Business name</label><input id="businessName" name="businessName" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="160" placeholder="Acme Home Services"></div>
<div class="field full"><label for="website">Website</label><input id="website" name="website" type="url" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" required maxlength="600" placeholder="https://example.com"></div>
