<div class="field"><label for="role">Your role</label><select id="role" name="role" required><option value="">Select</option><option value="owner">Owner</option><option value="founder">Founder</option><option value="executive">Executive / GM</option><option value="marketing">Marketing</option><option value="sales">Sales</option><option value="agency">Agency / consultant</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="acquisitionChannel">Main source of new customers</label><select id="acquisitionChannel" name="acquisitionChannel" required><option value="">Select</option><option value="google_ads">Google Ads</option><option value="local_services_ads">Google Local Services Ads</option><option value="meta_ads">Meta / Instagram Ads</option><option value="paid_search">Other paid search</option><option value="lead_marketplace">Lead marketplaces</option><option value="mixed_paid">Several paid channels</option><option value="seo">SEO / organic search</option><option value="organic_social">Organic social</option><option value="referrals">Referrals / repeat business</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="customerValueBand">Approx. value of one new customer</label><select id="customerValueBand" name="customerValueBand" required><option value="">Select</option><option value="under_250">Under $250</option><option value="250_1000">$250 to $1,000</option><option value="1000_5000">$1,000 to $5,000</option><option value="over_5000">$5,000+</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="monthlyLeadsBand">Approx. inbound leads per month</label><select id="monthlyLeadsBand" name="monthlyLeadsBand" required><option value="">Select</option><option value="under_10">Under 10</option><option value="10_25">10 to 25</option><option value="26_75">26 to 75</option><option value="over_75">75+</option></select></div>
<div class="field full hp" aria-hidden="true"><label for="company_website">Company website confirmation</label><input id="company_website" name="company_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
<div class="field full"><label class="consent"><input id="followUpConsent" name="followUpConsent" type="checkbox"><span>Email me this score and relevant follow-up about Revenue Rescue. I can opt out at any time.</span></label></div>
<div class="field full"><button id="submit" type="submit">Calculate My Score →</button><div class="status" id="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="micro">The score is a diagnostic risk index based on public evidence and the business context you provide. It is not an estimate of dollars lost.</div></div>
</div>
</form>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section"><div class="shell">
<div class="eyebrow">What The Scanner Checks</div>
<h3 class="section-title">Five places demand can disappear.</h3>
<div class="checks">
<div class="check"><span>01</span><h4>Demand capture</h4><p>Can a high-intent visitor take a clear next step without hunting for it?</p></div>
<div class="check"><span>02</span><h4>Conversion friction</h4><p>Does the buying path ask for too much, create confusion, or send people through generic steps?</p></div>
<div class="check"><span>03</span><h4>Trust architecture</h4><p>Is credible proof visible where a buyer is deciding whether to act?</p></div>
<div class="check"><span>04</span><h4>Follow-up and routing</h4><p>Do different intents appear to have a sensible path into the business?</p></div>
<div class="check"><span>05</span><h4>Measurement readiness</h4><p>Can the business tell which traffic and conversion work is actually paying off?</p></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section id="result" class="result-shell">
<div class="shell">
<div class="eyebrow">Your Revenue Leak Score</div>
<div class="result-head">
<div class="score-box"><div class="score-number" id="score-number">0</div><div class="score-denom">OUT OF 100 // PUBLIC-EVIDENCE RISK INDEX</div><div class="band" id="score-band"></div></div>
<div>
<div class="finding"><div class="eyebrow">Strongest Verified Finding</div><h3 id="finding-title">Finding</h3><p id="finding-evidence"></p><p class="implication" id="finding-implication"></p></div>
<div class="flags" id="flags"></div>
<div class="disclaimer" id="disclaimer"></div>
<div class="result-cta"><div class="price">$299</div><a class="cta" href="/revenue-rescue-sprint/">Get The Complete Revenue Rescue →</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
